@startuml
left to right direction
title Data Flow Diagram «Будущее 2.0»

rectangle "Партнёрские системы\n(фармкомпании, оборудование, финтех)" as Partners
rectangle "Регуляторы" as Regulators

rectangle "Integration Layer\n(API Gateway, Kafka Event Bus)" as Integration
rectangle "Data Platform (Lakehouse)\n(Data Lakehouse, Semantic Layer)" as DataPlatform
rectangle "Data Portal & BI\n(Data Portal, BI Platform)" as Analytics
rectangle "Clinical Domain\n(Clinical Services, AI Services,\nClinical Database)" as Clinical
rectangle "Fintech / Banking Domain\n(Core Banking)" as Fintech
rectangle "Legacy Systems\n(Legacy DWH)" as Legacy
rectangle "Security\n(IAM / SSO)" as Security

Partners --> Integration : API-интеграции / потоки данных
Clinical --> Integration : Medical events\n(CDC, domain events)
Fintech --> Integration : Financial events\n(CDC, domain events)
Integration --> DataPlatform : Streaming ingestion\n(Kafka topics)
Clinical --> DataPlatform : CDC / Batch выгрузки
Fintech --> DataPlatform : CDC / Batch выгрузки
Legacy --> DataPlatform : Historical loads\n(миграция)
DataPlatform --> Analytics : Curated datasets,\nmetrics, datamarts
Analytics --> Regulators : Регуляторная отчётность
Analytics --> Security : SSO / RLS / CLS
Integration --> Fintech : API / команды\nдля финтех-сервисов

Security --> Clinical
Security --> Fintech
Security --> DataPlatform

DataPlatform --> Clinical : Обезличенные данные\nдля моделей
Clinical --> Clinical : AI Services inference\n(внутридоменный поток)
@enduml